  "Earthquake **audible only with appropriate speakers**" by MBARI_MARS (https://freesound.org/s/369485/), the shock
  through the ground;
  "Rocket Launch Rumble (Geofon recording)" by felix.blume (https://freesound.org/s/613617/), the ground's rumble under
  the climb and the aftermath;
  "merrimack-st-demolition.aif" by alienistcog (https://freesound.org/s/125937/), the blast's second blow;
